        <div style="color:#2D5016;font-weight:700;font-size:0.85rem;">1200 × 800 px <span style="font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:500;color:#64748b;">(3:2 o 4:3)</span></div>
        <div style="font-size:0.75rem;color:#64748b;margin-top:0.35rem;line-height:1.4;">
